9:- No scripts, no code, no credentials, no server names in a pack. The one exception is `packs/_sources/**` (the source catalog, ADR-0013): it holds the tenant → server maps precisely so that no module pack ever needs one — server names yes, credentials never (only `vault://` references; no connection strings, no primary hosts). If a check cannot be expressed declaratively, write the gap into the unit's Progress; it becomes a kernel or adapter unit.
